      "seq": 1,
      "content_text": "只做这两件事，不要做别的：\n1. 用 Read 工具读当前目录下的 a.ts。\n2. 用 Edit 工具把 a.ts 里的 `export const x = 1` 改成 `export const x = 2`。\n做完用一句话说明改了什么，不要贴代码。",
      "content_path": null,
      "content_bytes": 0,
      "mentions_json": "[]",
      "inject_mode": "full",
      "summary_text": null,
      "created_at": 1790177869737,
      "edited_at": null,
      "deleted_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a58cf39e-4fe9-4c70-8a68-1b570d5f9d9e",
      "workspace_id": "1d8e5bf0-01db-4589-9e4e-4c6743130ba9",
      "session_id": "51072f45-ee32-47af-a0f6-5c4b0aabead8",
      "turn_id": "9613421c-f4e8-42aa-8b33-65b79b64adf5",
      "role": "assistant",
      "author_member_id": "c3ad8dc0-cb2a-4c33-8db2-1a9872ed3f6b",
      "seq": 2,
      "content_text": "I'll read a.ts first.把 a.ts 中 `export const x` 的值从 1 改成了 2，其余内容未动。",
      "content_path": null,
      "content_bytes": 98,
      "mentions_json": "[]",
      "inject_mode": "full",
      "summary_text": null,
      "created_at": 1790177871238,
      "edited_at": null,
      "deleted_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f406f057-fd9d-4736-9ce7-ce28a408d321",
      "workspace_id": "1d8e5bf0-01db-4589-9e4e-4c6743130ba9",
      "session_id": "51072f45-ee32-47af-a0f6-5c4b0aabead8",
      "turn_id": null,
      "role": "user",
      "author_member_id": "c3ad8dc0-cb2a-4c33-8db2-1a9872ed3f6b",
      "seq": 3,
      "content_text": "按顺序做，不要跳步：用 Read 工具依次读 a.ts、b.ts、c.ts、d.ts 四个文件，\n每读完一个就用一句话概括它的内容，最后用一句话总结这四个文件是干什么的。\n不要修改任何文件。",
      "content_path": null,
      "content_bytes": 0,
      "mentions_json": "[]",
      "inject_mode": "full",
      "summary_text": null,
      "created_at": 1790177873752,
      "edited_at": null,
      "deleted_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0b6353ab-6f97-446a-a853-969460eade06",
      "workspace_id": "1d8e5bf0-01db-4589-9e4e-4c6743130ba9",
      "session_id": "51072f45-ee32-47af-a0f6-5c4b0aabead8",
      "turn_id": "5c0e2465-4388-4914-b243-1b594a9b20f8",
      "role": "assistant",
      "author_member_id": "c3ad8dc0-cb2a-4c33-8db2-1a9872ed3f6b",
      "seq": 4,
      "content_text": "**a.ts** — 导出两个常量 `x = 2` 和 `y = 2`，只含数值定义。**b.ts** — 导出一个 `add(a, b)` 函数，返回两数之和。**c.ts** — 导出项目名 `NAME = 'code-chat'` 和版本号 `VERSION = '0.1.0'` 两个元数据常量。**d.ts** — 定义一个 `Id` 类型别名（`string`）和一个含 `id: Id` 字段的 `Node` 接口。\n\n**总结**：这四个文件共同构成一个极小的 TypeScript 沙箱模块——`b.ts` 提供 `add` 加法函数，`a.ts` 提供两个数值常量，`c.ts` 提供包名与版本号，`d.ts` 提供基础类型定义（`Id` 与 `Node`），整体只是用于演示模块导出与类型声明的最小样例集合。\n\n未修改任何文件。",
      "content_path": null,
      "content_bytes": 701,
      "mentions_json": "[]",
      "inject_mode": "full",
      "summary_text": null,
      "created_at": 1790177875392,
